  "prompt_text": "Continue the text below with exactly one short, natural, coherent English sentence. Return only the continuation, with no preamble or explanation:\nThe Struggles and Loneliness of Isolation\n\n\nWe can talk about how scary it is to be alone, how lonely it feels, and the gnawing fear of abandonment that we carry around. We can talk about how it hurts to be rejected and criticized, and how it feels to be ignored. We can talk about the fear of being on our own, and of having to depend on ourselves. We can talk about the anxiety that we feel when life doesn’t go as planned, and how we can fall apart when our plans are derailed.  We can talk about how we’ve tried to do everything in our power to fit in, and yet somehow we're always on our own. Lovers leave us, friends slowly disappear from our lives either because they've moved to another state or country or perhaps they moved on with someone else.",
